Checks item availability against `InventoryService` and rejects orders whose shipping address falls outside a supported region.

```java
public void validateOrder(Order order) {
    if (!inventoryService.hasStock(order.getItems())) {
        throw new OrderValidationException("OUT_OF_STOCK");
    }
    if (!shippingZones.contains(order.getAddress().getRegion())) {
        throw new OrderValidationException("UNSUPPORTED_REGION");
    }
}
```
